mehawk@reed.edu (Michael Sandy) writes:

=> Someone said that if you bash them or something they turn into books,
=> was that nethack or some other game?  I tried kicking, forcebolt and
=> pickaxe but no dice.  Any advice?

Advice:
Collect boulders, polymorph them into statues, and you've got a good
chance of getting spellbooks when you destroy them with  your pickaxe.

Advice2:
Try (using a tinning kit to preserve them) to collect large piles of 
food. When polymorphing you have a small chance to get tins of spinach
(for strength) or tins of Wraight (spelling?) meat. To identify your tins
you must eat them, therefore it's a good idea to have plenty of each kind
rather than plenty kinds.

